//Cheats/Access Event Debug Menu - Quick Load File 01 Page 1 Start normally Starts the game normally. The in-game menu will still be using the selections present from the Event Screen Debug Menu. Game completion will lead the player to the Album menu. Common route Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Common route.Leni Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Leni route.Seizh Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Seizh route.Kyle Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Kyle route.Advances to the next page.Page 2 Returns to the previous page.Sena Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Sena route. Zero Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Zero route.Zero - New Route Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Zero New  route. Unan Displays a selection of events pertaining to the Unan route.Event Recollection Advances to Event Recollection mode. Unlocks Event Recollection
